1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,754
Grandpa, Ellen, Philip, Robbie, you and me.

2
00:00:04,754 --> 00:00:10,792
That's six steaks.

3
00:00:10,792 --> 00:00:13,770
Don't forget Susan.

4
00:00:13,770 --> 00:00:17,718
Seven steaks.

5
00:00:17,718 --> 00:00:21,992
Cooking dinner for the entire family is not so easy.

6
00:00:21,992 --> 00:00:25,835
The shopping: the salad:

7
00:00:25,835 --> 00:00:32,936
tomatoes, lettuce, cucumbers, and onions.

8
00:00:32,936 --> 00:00:40,831
The main course: steak and potatoes.

9
00:00:40,831 --> 00:00:45,480
Richard, how much broccoli do I need for seven people?

10
00:00:45,480 --> 00:00:49,719
Marilyn, I have to tell you something.

11
00:00:49,719 --> 00:00:52,639
At today's exercise class...

12
00:00:52,639 --> 00:00:56,762
Yes, Richard.

13
00:00:56,762 --> 00:01:04,120
Well, I didn't really exercise.

14
00:01:04,120 --> 00:01:05,136
I knew it!

15
00:01:05,136 --> 00:01:09,469
I wanted to, but Jack Davis needed a photographer.

16
00:01:09,469 --> 00:01:11,910
I'm sorry, Marilyn.

17
00:01:11,910 --> 00:01:14,374
I don't understand. Did you exercise or not?

18
00:01:14,374 --> 00:01:17,750
No. Instead of exercising, I photographed the class.

19
00:01:17,750 --> 00:01:19,432
And you didn't exercise?

20
00:01:19,432 --> 00:01:25,727
No.

21
00:01:25,727 --> 00:01:31,987
There's another advanced class today at four o'clock.

22
00:01:31,987 --> 00:01:33,973
We'll go together.

23
00:01:33,973 --> 00:01:35,304
What about the bet?

24
00:01:35,304 --> 00:01:45,126
Oh, the bet is still on, but you shop for the groceries.

25
00:01:45,126 --> 00:01:51,305
Remember, you win, and I cook dinner for the entire family.

26
00:01:51,305 --> 00:01:56,187
You win, and I cook dinner for the entire family.

27
00:01:56,187 --> 00:01:59,831
Including Susan.

28
00:01:59,831 --> 00:02:05,320
Four o'clock at the advanced exercise class. With me.

29
00:02:05,320 --> 00:02:06,126
Don't forget to breathe.

30
00:02:06,126 --> 00:02:07,399
Skip, hop, front.

31
00:02:07,399 --> 00:02:08,824
Twist... again.... OK, now... scissors.

32
00:02:08,824 --> 00:02:13,134
This is fun. It's a piece of cake.

33
00:02:13,134 --> 00:02:15,902
Yeah. Just wait.

34
00:02:15,902 --> 00:02:23,108
5, 6, 7, go right, 1, 2, back,

35
00:02:23,108 --> 00:02:27,581
2, 3 , 1, 2, 3, pony, pony...

36
00:02:27,581 --> 00:02:36,376
1, 2, 3, kick... 1, 2, 3, kick... pony.

37
00:02:36,376 --> 00:02:39,611
And twist, twist.

38
00:02:39,611 --> 00:02:42,589
OK. Let's pick up the pace.

39
00:02:42,589 --> 00:02:45,159
How are you doing, Richard?

40
00:02:45,159 --> 00:02:56,207
I can barely move.

41
00:02:56,207 --> 00:03:02,654
2, 3, 4, front. Now we're going to run it off.

42
00:03:02,654 --> 00:03:04,862
Front... knees up, knees up.

43
00:03:04,862 --> 00:03:09,148
OK. Finish off by jogging in place.

44
00:03:09,148 --> 00:03:11,344
OK. Keep those knees up.

45
00:03:11,344 --> 00:03:14,018
All right. That's it for today.

46
00:03:14,018 --> 00:03:17,499
Thank you, everyone. See you next week.

47
00:03:17,499 --> 00:03:20,804
Thank you, Jack, but no thank you.

48
00:03:20,804 --> 00:03:27,181
The advanced exercise class is not so easy, huh?

49
00:03:27,181 --> 00:03:35,719
No, no, you were right. I was wrong.

50
00:03:35,719 --> 00:03:39,993
Come on, Richard. Get up. Let's go.

51
00:03:39,993 --> 00:03:43,883
You have to cook dinner for the entire family.

52
00:03:43,883 --> 00:03:49,430
Marilyn, I'm exhausted. I can't move.

53
00:03:49,430 --> 00:03:53,541
Oh, you'll do it. It's a piece of cake.

54
00:03:53,541 --> 00:03:57,828
Excuse me, Richard, Marilyn.

55
00:03:57,828 --> 00:04:00,409
You are a terrific instructor, Jack.

56
00:04:00,409 --> 00:04:03,843
Thanks. But I have a question.

57
00:04:03,843 --> 00:04:08,059
Is this your very first advanced aerobics class?

58
00:04:08,059 --> 00:04:10,780
Yes, it is.

59
00:04:10,780 --> 00:04:13,502
You are in great shape, Richard.

60
00:04:13,502 --> 00:04:15,732
Very few people last in this class

61
00:04:15,732 --> 00:04:20,941
for the full hour the very first time.

62
00:04:20,941 --> 00:04:25,636
It's true. You are in great shape.

63
00:04:25,636 --> 00:04:27,038
Thanks!

64
00:04:27,038 --> 00:04:27,038
I think we'll cook dinner together.
